      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The gift badge is not supposed to show the *true number* of gifts given, it has very specific badge labels that has a number on it. If you are in between, the number won't exactly match your number of purchases.\n\nYou can see full list of these badges here: https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Badges#Gifting_badges",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
