      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you have gifted a total of 5 months, then you might qualify for the \"Gift (5 Months)\" badge, but it hasn't updated to show that yet.\n\nYou should contact VRChat support, they can confirm if there is an issue or not. You make a support ticket here: https://vrch.at/support\n\nYou might be right that it is slightly slow at granting these badge upgrades. It is not uncommon for people to complain about it in the #community-support section on the Discord server, hence why I commonly just direct people to VRChat support. So maybe there is an issue/bug, but I assume the VRChat support team is aware of it then.",
